          <div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">TPRM SUBPAGE 02</p><h2>Vendor Risk Tiering Matrix</h2><p class="lede">Classify all vendors by inherent risk to determine due diligence depth, monitoring frequency, and contract requirements.</p></div><span class="file-count">TPRM</span></div>
          <p class="muted">Used by TPRM Committee for vendor onboarding decisions and annual re-tiering.</p>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">1. TIER DEFINITIONS</p><h3>Vendor risk tiers</h3></div></div><div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Risk level</th><th>Definition</th><th>Typical profile</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Tier 1</td><td data-translate-ui>High</td><td data-translate-ui>Processes sensitive data nasabah dan data keuangan, has administrative access to critical systems, or integrates with core banking, kanal digital, atau sistem pembayaran. A breach could cause material harm.</td><td data-translate-ui>penyedia core banking, payment gateway/switch, cloud, credit bureau, dan managed security service</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Tier 2</td><td data-translate-ui>Medium</td><td data-translate-ui>Processes limited data nasabah dan data keuangan or has restricted system access. Breach impact is moderate.</td><td data-translate-ui>CRM perbankan, platform analitik, penyedia KYC/e-KYC, contact center, dan IT support</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Tier 3</td><td data-translate-ui>Low</td><td data-translate-ui>No data nasabah dan data keuangan access or only anonymized/aggregated data. Breach impact is minimal.</td><td data-translate-ui>Office supplies, training providers, non-data nasabah dan data keuangan consultants</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
