          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">3. TIER ASSIGNMENT RULES</p><h3>Approvals and overrides</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td>0-40</td><td><strong>Tier 1 (High)</strong><small>CISO + Data Protection Officer / Compliance + Legal</small></td></tr><tr><td>41-70</td><td><strong>Tier 2 (Medium)</strong><small>CISO or delegate + Business Owner</small></td></tr><tr><td>71-100</td><td><strong>Tier 3 (Low)</strong><small>Business Owner</small></td></tr></tbody></table></article><article class="insight-panel"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><p class="eyebrow">OVERRIDE RULES</p><h3>Re-tier triggers</h3></div></div><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>core banking, kanal digital, atau sistem pembayaran access</strong><span>+15 penalty</span></li><li><strong>Offshore weak jurisdiction</strong><span>+10 penalty</span></li><li><strong>Sole source critical function</strong><span>Flag concentration risk</span></li><li><strong>data nasabah dan data keuangan breach in 24 months</strong><span>Automatic Tier 1</span></li></ul></article></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">4-6. CONTROL REQUIREMENTS</p><h3>Due diligence, monitoring, and contracts</h3></div></div><div class="excel-wrap"><table class="excel-table tprm-framework-table"><thead><tr><th>Requirement</th><th>Tier 1</th><th>Tier 2</th><th>Tier 3</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-translate-ui>Full due diligence questionnaire</td><td data-translate-ui>Required</td><td data-translate-ui>Required</td><td data-translate-ui>Not required</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Technical assessment</td><td data-translate-ui>Required</td><td data-translate-ui>If data nasabah dan data keuangan involved</td><td data-translate-ui>Not required</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Reference checks</td><td data-translate-ui>3 or more</td><td data-translate-ui>2 or more</td><td data-translate-ui>Not required</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>On-site / remote audit</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual on-site</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual remote</td><td data-translate-ui>Triennial or trigger-based</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Security questionnaire refresh</td><td data-translate-ui>Quarterly</td><td data-translate-ui>Biannual</td><td data-translate-ui>Annual</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>perjanjian pemrosesan data dan kerahasiaan and audit rights</td><td data-translate-ui>Mandatory</td><td data-translate-ui>If data nasabah dan data keuangan / mandatory audit</td><td data-translate-ui>If data nasabah dan data keuangan</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Breach notification</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 48 hours</td><td data-translate-ui>Within 72 hours</td><td data-translate-ui>If data nasabah dan data keuangan</td></tr><tr><td data-translate-ui>Cyber insurance</td><td data-translate-ui>$5M minimum</td><td data-translate-ui>$2M minimum</td><td data-translate-ui>Not required</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
          <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">7-10. OPERATING REFERENCE</p><h3>Re-tiering, manufacturing, register, and calculation</h3></div></div><div class="tprm-grid"><article class="insight-panel"><ul class="tprm-list"><li><strong>Re-tiering</strong><span>Annual review, data scope change, data nasabah dan data keuangan incident, merger, regulation, or KPI deterioration</span></li><li><strong>Layanan keuangan</strong><span>core banking, kanal digital, atau sistem pembayaran code, akses ke core banking atau kanal pembayaran, or biometrics normally adds +15 and likely Tier 1</span></li><li><strong>Register</strong><span>Vendor ID, name, service, four dimension scores, total, tier, last and next assessment</span></li></ul></article><article class="insight-panel"><table class="tprm-tier-table"><tbody><tr><td>40%</td><td><strong>data nasabah dan data keuangan Exposure</strong><small>Score x 40, inverted: 5 means no exposure</small></td></tr><tr><td>30%</td><td><strong>Security Maturity</strong><small>Score x 30</small></td></tr><tr><td>10%</td><td><strong>Financial Stability</strong><small>Score x 10</small></td></tr><tr><td>20%</td><td><strong>Reputation</strong><small>Score x 20</small></td></tr><tr><td>500</td><td><strong>Maximum possible</strong><small>Tier 1 <= 200, Tier 2 201-350, Tier 3 351-500</small></td></tr></tbody></table></article></div>
